                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Egan to Mr. Blaine</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1891-12-24"><hi rendition="#italic">December 24,
                        1891</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Egan acknowledges the instructions relating to publicity of dispatches and
                    says that he will strictly comply and has exercised the greatest care in that
                    respect.</p>
            </div>
